Package: devos-audio
Version: 1.0.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DevOS <security@devos.local>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pipewire-alsa, wireplumber
Recommends: pavucontrol
Description: Audio diagnostics and repair for DevOS
 devos-audio reports the sound cards, kernel modules, firmware, PipeWire
 nodes and mixer state, plays a test tone and applies safe repairs
 (audio group, unmute, audio stack restart, default sink repair from
 dummy/dead to the real sink, volume floor, stray stream move). Includes
 an end-to-end "verify" command (tone -> real sink capture -> PASS/FAIL),
 a session guard unit that keeps the output ready at login and on every
 audio-stack restart, and a "DevOS Audio" launcher for the app grid.
 1.0.6: parsing fix in status/guard move loop — verbose sink-inputs
 "Input #N" lines have no $3 field (id is $2 minus '#').
